 81	2. Review every record whose \`quality.recommendedForSft\` is false.
 82	3. Use ChatML or Alpaca only after reviewing unscored completions.
 83	4. Use KTO and DPO files only where explicit feedback supports the label or preference.
 84	5. Keep source groups in their assigned split to reduce leakage.
